# Buttons — cursor: pointer

Every **clickable button** must show a hand cursor (`cursor: pointer`).

## Single source

The base style is **`src/style.css`** — all `button` elements and clickable keys get `cursor: pointer` automatically. New buttons **do not** need a repeated `cursor-pointer` class unless there is a special case.

Disabled buttons: `cursor: not-allowed`.

## Do not

- ❌ A button with the default arrow cursor
- ❌ `cursor-default` on active buttons
